error[V0304]: `r` belongs to the caller of this function, so it cannot be used up by `unwrap_or`
 --> crates/varyk/tests/fixtures/errors/v0304_unwrap_or_on_stored_result/main.vr:2:5
  |
2 |     r.unwrap_or(0)
  |     ^ `r` belongs to the caller of this function, so it cannot be used up by `unwrap_or`
  |
  = note: `unwrap_or` uses up the value it is called on, and what is inside this one cannot be copied out; match on it instead
  = note: in Rust terms, a borrowed value cannot move into a place that owns it
